WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.775
What else does Google leave to you?

2
00:00:01.775 --> 00:00:05.106
Impacts are nested product
and location objects,

3
00:00:05.106 --> 00:00:09.087
so the kit turns them into the
record's services and regions.

4
00:00:09.087 --> 00:00:11.745
An event's description is sometimes empty,

5
00:00:11.745 --> 00:00:14.250
so the kit takes the latest update's text.

6
00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:19.075
Nothing says action is required, and
the kit adds no rule of its own here:

7
00:00:19.075 --> 00:00:24.400
an open incident that names resources
routes by the agency's rule, in Chapter 6.

8
00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:27.609
The organization call is
verified in REST but its

9
00:00:27.609 --> 00:00:31.288
command-line flags weren't
read, so it's marked unverified.

10
00:00:31.288 --> 00:00:33.801
And two response shapes are both accepted.

11
00:00:33.801 --> 00:00:38.010
The verdict: use Google's project
call and viewer role as published,

12
00:00:38.010 --> 00:00:40.680
build the mapping, and
write the gaps down.
